# .prettierignore
# Tell Prettier which files/directories to skip.
# Used by: format.ps1 (via `npx prettier -w .` or `-c .`)
#
# Key decisions:
#   bin/ obj/        – compiled output; never format build artifacts.
#   wwwroot/         – often contains vendored or minified files.
#   /publish/        – dotnet publish output.
#   *.verified.json  – Verify snapshot files; these are intentionally raw and
#                       must not be reformatted or diffs will be meaningless.
#   coverage.json    – reportgenerator intermediate; not source.
#
# Add additional generated directories specific to your project below.

bin/
obj/
wwwroot/
/publish/
*.verified.json
coverage.json
